flowchart LR
  A[Official and reviewed public sources] --> B[Safe acquisition and immutable snapshot]
  B --> C[Document parsing and passage anchors]
  C --> D[Candidate claims and actions]
  D --> E[Human review and adjudication]
  E --> F[Frozen evidence snapshot]

  G[G7 commitment and chapter methodology] --> H[Literal Covenant package]
  H --> I[Compiler to canonical IR]
  I --> J[Static analyzer]
  J --> K[Approved interpretation profile]

  F --> L[Deterministic evaluator]
  I --> L
  K --> L
  L --> M[Proof-carrying evaluation receipt]
  M --> N[Benchmark matrix and reports]
  M --> O[Signed release manifest]
  O --> P[Public explorer and verification CLI]

  Q[Models] -. discovery and candidate proposals only .-> D
  Q -. never publishes scores .-> L
